   "Semiconductor volatility is increasingly driving the Nasdaq-100 Volatility Index (VXN) rather than being a passive component of it.",
   "Deteriorating liquidity in the semiconductor sector is amplifying price moves and increasing vulnerability to forced selling from VaR-sensitive investors like hedge funds and CTAs.",
